title: The udev rule that worked until the next reboot
date: 2026-11-08
summary: >-
  Our serial devices had friendly names like /dev/battery, until a reboot made
  them disappear. The rule matched on an IRQ number that the kernel does not
  promise to keep.
tags:
  - Linux
